// The `windows_arm64` system target definition (file shape settled 2026-07-07:
// `system/targets/<target>.omg` = the target def; checked per-subsystem target
// implementations live beneath `system/targets/windows_arm64/`). Windows ARM64
// reuses the Windows adapters under `system/targets/windows_x86_64/`; `build.omg`
// selects them for this target by ordinary rows. Target filtering keeps
// non-selected implementations inert.
